\par
Big data prioritization in SCM decision-making: Its role and
\par
performance implications\ding{73}
\par
Carla Wilkin ⁎, Ald\'onio Ferreira, Kristian Rotaru, Luigi Red Gaerlan
\par
Department of Accounting, Monash Business School, Monash University, Victoria, Australia
\par
a r t i c l e i n f o
