\par
The third parameter, S, represents the information security
\par
investment. It can take many forms, such as purchasing firewall,
\par
installing intrusion detection systems or training users.
\par
Developing effective security investment strategies can prevent
\par
the damage from attackers (Andoh-Baidoo \& Osei-Bryson, 2007).
\par
Thus the purpose of investing in information security is to decrease
\par
the breach probability. We formalise the above observations in the
\par
