\emph{``Hmm, let me think a bit\dots, err we do not have such kinds}
\par
\emph{of procedures.} \emph{We have never had such a delicate situation.}
\par
\emph{We have the firewall and antivirus software which are}
\par
\emph{under my strict control so it is unlikely to happen here\dots{} ``}
