\emph{``\dots as I said we do not have a cyber-security policy created}
\par
\emph{but everyone in the company is aware that they have to}
\par
\emph{focus on their work activities and not to do Facebooking at}
\par
\emph{the worktime.''}
\par
When it comes to information value prioritization requirement, IT professional 4
\par
complies with it by explaining:
\par
51\emph{``\dots we are a very small company and our most valuable}
\par
\emph{asset is prices of company's services. We offer different}
\par
\emph{prices to different clients so if this information would be}
